**Sessions:** Apache 2.0 (Slides: [[]PDF](/slides/eu-2000/M04-A.pdf) | [[]HTML](/slides/eu-2000/M04-B/Apache-2.0.htm)); Writing Apache Modules for 2.0 (Slides: [[]PDF](/slides/eu-2000/M10-A.pdf) | [[]HTML](/slides/eu-2000/M10-B/modules.htm))

