### Jim Jagielski

![[]Jim Jagielski](/images/events/apachecon-eu-2000/people/jim_jagielski_72x98.jpg)

**Sessions:** ApacheCon Europe 2000 Closing Session; ApacheCon Europe 2000 Opening Session; Running a Successful Web Hosting Company (Slides: [[]PDF](/slides/eu-2000/W01-A.pdf) | [[]PDF](/slides/eu-2000/W01-B.pdf) | [[]PDF](/slides/eu-2000/W01-C.pdf))

Jim's been active on the 'Net since the early
80's, starting as editor of the A/UX FAQ. He
worked on the NCSA server and joined the
Apache Group at a very early stage, where he
focused on portability and the configuration and
